WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:22.700
The second day of the Satipatthana course is over.

00:22.700 --> 00:39.460
This evening, let us go through this discourse and understand in relation to the actual

00:39.460 --> 00:53.780
practice that we are doing.

00:53.780 --> 00:59.820
The name of the discourse is Mahasatipatthana Sutran.

